Rule 4 (If dim is a list, all dimensions must be within the valid range for the input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : -1 * ndim(v_1) ≤ v_2[i] ∧ v_2[i] < ndim(v_1)
